r initiated login using an external Identity Provider | Insight Platform Administration Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"This article contains guidance on how to use the new Service Provider Initiated Login feature available for the Command Platform.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insight/sp-initiated-login/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"- Service Provider initiated login\"},{\"name\":\"default-access-profile\",\"route\":\"/insight/default-access-profile\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Default access profile | Insight Platform Administration Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insight/default-access-profile/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Default access profile\"},{\"name\":\"multi-factor-authentication\",\"route\":\"/insight/multi-factor-authentication\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Multi-factor authentication | Insight Platform Administration Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"Learn how to configure multi-factor authentication for your users.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insight/multi-factor-authentication/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Multi-factor authentication\"},{\"name\":\"---7\",\"type\":\"separator\",\"title\":\"Global Settings\"},{\"name\":\"platform-settings\",\"route\":\"/insight/platform-settings\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Manage Company Settings | Insight Platform Administration Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"Adjust details of your company profile, display name, contacts, and designate an assistance resource for your users.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insight/platform-settings/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Manage company settings\"},{\"name\":\"customize-session-timeout-settings\",\"route\":\"/insight/customize-session-timeout-settings\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Customize session timeout settings | Insight Platform Administration Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"Configure how long your users can remain idle before their session expires.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insight/customize-session-timeout-settings/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Customize session timeout settings\"},{\"name\":\"audit-logging\",\"route\":\"/insight/audit-logging\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Audit logging | Insight Platform Administration Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"Learn how to use the Command Platform's audit logging feature.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insight/audit-logging/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Audit logging\"},{\"name\":\"managed-multi-org-user-management\",\"route\":\"/insight/managed-multi-org-user-management\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Managed Multi Org User Management | Insight Platform Administration Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insight/managed-multi-org-user-management/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Managed multi-org user management\"},{\"name\":\"---8\",\"type\":\"separator\",\"title\":\"API\"},{\"name\":\"api-overview\",\"route\":\"/insight/api-overview\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Command Platform API overview | Insight Platform Administration Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"Learn about the different APIs the Command Platform supports.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insight/api-overview/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Rapid7 Platform API overview\"},{\"name\":\"managing-platform-api-keys\",\"route\":\"/insight/managing-platform-api-keys\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Manage Platform API Keys | Insight Platform Administration Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"What is a user key? What is an organization key? How do I generate an API key? How do I revoke an API key?\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insight/managing-platform-api-keys/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Manage Rapid7 Platform API keys\"},{\"name\":\"managing-multi-tenant-api-keys\",\"route\":\"/insight/managing-multi-tenant-api-keys\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Manage Multi-Tenant API Keys | Insight Platform Administration Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"What is a user key? What is an organization key? How do I generate an API key? How do I revoke an API key?\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insight/managing-multi-tenant-api-keys/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Manage Multi-Tenant API Keys\"},{\"name\":\"product-apis\",\"route\":\"/insight/product-apis\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Available product APIs | Insight Platform Administration Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"This article contains a list of available cloud-based Rapid7 product and feature APIs and the base URLs you will need to use them.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insight/product-apis/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Available product APIs\"},{\"name\":\"---9\",\"type\":\"separator\",\"title\":\"The Extension Library\"},{\"name\":\"what-is-the-extension-library\",\"route\":\"/insight/what-is-the-extension-library\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"What is the Extension Library? | Insight Platform Administration Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"Learn about the Rapid7 Extension Library.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insight/what-is-the-extension-library/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"What is the Extension Library?\"},{\"name\":\"contributing-an-extension\",\"route\":\"/insight/contributing-an-extension\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Contributing an extension | Insight Platform Administration Documentation\",\"slug\":\"contributing-an-extension\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insight/contributing-an-extension/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Contributing an extension\"},{\"name\":\"---10\",\"type\":\"separator\",\"title\":\"Community\"},{\"name\":\"discussion-community\",\"route\":\"/insight/discussion-community\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Rapid7 discussion community | Insight Platform Administration Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"Learn about the Rapid7 discussion community.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insight/discussion-community/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Rapid7 discussion community\"},{\"name\":\"share-an-idea\",\"route\":\"/insight/share-an-idea\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Share an idea with Rapid7 | Insight Platform Administration Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"Have an idea for how we can make our products better? Read on to learn how to share it with us.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insight/share-an-idea/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Share an idea with Rapid7\"},{\"name\":\"---11\",\"type\":\"separator\",\"title\":\"Release Notes\"},{\"name\":\"command-platform-release-notes\",\"route\":\"/insight/command-platform-release-notes\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Command Platform Release Notes | Insight Platform Administration Documentation\",\"slug\":\"command-platform-release notes\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insight/command-platform-release-notes/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Command Platform\"},{\"name\":\"release-notes-2026-july\",\"route\":\"/insight/release-notes-2026-july\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"July 2026 Release Notes | Insight Platform Administration Documentation\",\"slug\":\"release-notes-2026-july\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insight/release-notes-2026-july/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"- July 2026\"},{\"name\":\"release-notes-2026-june\",\"route\":\"/insight/release-notes-2026-june\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"June 2026 Release Notes | Insight Platform Administration Documentation\",\"slug\":\"release-notes-2026-june\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insight/release-notes-2026-june/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"- June 2026\"},{\"name\":\"release-notes-2026-may\",\"route\":\"/insight/release-notes-2026-may\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"May 2026 Release Notes | Insight Platform Administration Documentation\",\"slug\":\"release-notes-2026-may\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insight/release-notes-2026-may/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"- May 2026\"},{\"name\":\"release-notes-2026-april\",\"rout