:52:45.754Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2019-07-17T21:06:40.485Z\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insight-agent/benefits/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Benefits\"},{\"name\":\"data-collected\",\"route\":\"/insight-agent/data-collected\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"How the Rapid7 Agent (Insight Agent) Works | Rapid7 Agent Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"Learn how the Rapid7 Agent (Insight Agent) operates, what components it deploys, and the types of data it collects.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insight-agent/data-collected/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"How the Rapid7 Agent (Insight Agent) Works\"},{\"name\":\"sysmon-installer-events-monitor-overview\",\"route\":\"/insight-agent/sysmon-installer-events-monitor-overview\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Sysmon Installer and Events Monitor - how the Rapid7 Agent (Insight Agent) implements these components for use with SIEM (InsightIDR) and MDR | Rapid7 Agent Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"Learn how the Rapid7 Agent (Insight Agent) implements the Sysmon Installer and Events Monitor components for use with SIEM (InsightIDR) and MDR.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insight-agent/sysmon-installer-events-monitor-overview/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"- Sysmon Installer and Events Monitor overview\"},{\"name\":\"how-the-insight-agent-software-updates\",\"route\":\"/insight-agent/how-the-insight-agent-software-updates\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Rapid7 Agent (Insight Agent) software updates | Rapid7 Agent Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"Learn how the Rapid7 Agent (Insight Agent) updates itself and about available configuration options.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insight-agent/how-the-insight-agent-software-updates/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"- Software Updates\"},{\"name\":\"endpoint-prevention-overview\",\"route\":\"/insight-agent/endpoint-prevention-overview\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Endpoint Prevention overview | Rapid7 Agent Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"This article contains deployment and usage information that guides you through the complete process of setting up an Endpoint Prevention technology for your organization.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insight-agent/endpoint-prevention-overview/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"- Endpoint Prevention\"},{\"name\":\"insight-agent-version-3-faqs\",\"route\":\"/insight-agent/insight-agent-version-3-faqs\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions | Rapid7 Agent Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"This article contains some FAQs related to Rapid7 Agent (Insight Agent) version 3, the latest major version of the Rapid7 Agent (Insight Agent) software.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insight-agent/insight-agent-version-3-faqs/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"},{\"name\":\"---2\",\"type\":\"separator\",\"title\":\"Requirements\"},{\"name\":\"requirements\",\"route\":\"/insight-agent/requirements\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Rapid7 Agent (Insight Agent) requirements - an overview | Rapid7 Agent Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"This article contains a high-level view of the requirements you will need to meet to deploy the Rapid7 Agent (Insight Agent) on your assets.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insight-agent/requirements/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Rapid7 Agent (Insight Agent) requirements\"},{\"name\":\"operating-system\",\"route\":\"/insight-agent/operating-system\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Rapid7 Agent (Insight Agent) requirements - operating system support | Rapid7 Agent Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"This article lists the operating systems that the Rapid7 Agent (Insight Agent) supports.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insight-agent/operating-system/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"- Operating system support\"},{\"name\":\"network-traffic-and-connectivity-requirements\",\"route\":\"/insight-agent/network-traffic-and-connectivity-requirements\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Rapid7 Agent (Insight Agent) requirements - network traffic and connectivity | Rapid7 Agent Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"This article details all network traffic and connectivity requirements that your assets need to meet if they have an Rapid7 Agent (Insight Agent) installed.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insight-agent/network-traffic-and-connectivity-requirements/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"- Network traffic and connectivity\"},{\"name\":\"epp-software-requirements\",\"route\":\"/insight-agent/epp-software-requirements\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Rapid7 Agent (Insight Agent) requirements - endpoint protection software exclusion | Rapid7 Agent Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"This article explains how to exclude the Rapid7 Agent (Insight Agent) and its processes from common endpoint protection products.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insight-agent/epp-software-requirements/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"- Endpoint protection software exclusion\"},{\"name\":\"quarantine-action-configuration\",\"route\":\"/insight-agent/quarantine-action-configuration\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Rapid7 Agent (Insight Agent) requirements - SIEM (InsightIDR) asset quarantine | Rapid7 Agent Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"Configure the Rapid7 Agent (Insight Agent) to quarantine an asset in SIEM (InsightIDR).\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insight-agent/quarantine-action-configuration/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"- SIEM (InsightIDR) asset quarantine\"},{\"name\":\"endpoint-prevention-requirements\",\"route\":\"/insight-agent/endpoint-prevention-requirements\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Endpoint Prevention technology requirements | Rapid7 Agent Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"This article contains a high-level view of the requirements you will need to meet to deploy Endpoint Prevention add-ons on your assets.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insight-agent/endpoint-prevention-requirements/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Endpoint Prevention requirements\"},{\"name\":\"pre-deployment-requirements\",\"route\":\"/insight-agent/pre-deployment-requirements\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Pre-Deployment Requirements for Next Generation Antivirus \u0026 Ransomware Prevention | Rapid7 Agent Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insight-agent/pre-deployment-requirements/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"- Pre-deployment requirements\"},{\"name\":\"ngav-requirements\",\"route\":\"/insight-agent/ngav-requirements\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Next-Generation Antivirus add-on requirements | Rapid7 Agent Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"This article contains the requirements you will need to meet to install and deploy the Next-Generation Antivirus add-on on your assets.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insight-agent/ngav-requirements/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"- Next-Generation Antivirus requirements\"},{\"name\":\"ransomware-prevention-requirements\",\"route\":\"/insight-agent/ransomware-prevention-requirements\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Ransomware Prevention add-on requirements | Rapid7 Agent Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"This article contains the requirements you will need to meet to install and deploy the Ransomware Prevention add-on on your assets.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insight-agent/ransomware-prevention-requirements/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"- Ransomware Prevention requirements\"},{\"name\":\"---3\",\"type\":\"separator\",\"title\":\"Install\"},{\"name\":\"install\",\"route\":\"/insight-agent/install\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Download and Install the Rapid7 Agent (Insight Agent) | Rapid7 Agent Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"Learn about the different options you can use to install and download the Rapid7 Agent (Insight Agent).\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insight-agent/install/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Rapid7 Agent (Insight Agent) Download and Installation Overview\"},{\"name\":\"insight-agent-version-history\",\"route\":\"/insight-agent/insight-agent-version-history\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Rapid7 Agent (Insight Agent) Version History | Rapid7 Agent Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"View the SHA signature for the agent package that you would like to deploy to make sure the package hasn't been corrupted.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insight-agent/insight-agent-version-history/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"HIDDEN\"},{\"name\":\"migration-guide\",\"route\":\"/insight-agent/migration-guide\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Migration Script Instructions | Rapid7 Agent Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"Follow the guide below if you have previously installed the Rapid7 Agent (Insight Agent) with either `.deb` or `.rpm` as part of our Open Preview program\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insight-agent/migration-guide/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"HIDDEN\"},{\"name\":\"windows-installation\",\"route\":\"/insight-agent/windows-installation\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Windows Installation | Rapid7 Agent Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"This article guides you through the installation process for the Rapid7 Agent (Insight Agent) on Windows.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insight-agent/windows-installation/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"- Windows Installation\"},{\"name\":\"mac-installation\",\"route\":\"/insight-agent/mac-installation\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Mac Installation | Rapid7 Agent Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"This article guides you through this installation process for the Rapid7 Agent (Insight Agent) on Mac.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insight-agent/mac-installation/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"- Mac Installation\"},{\"name\":\"linux-installation\",\"route\":\"/insight-agent/linux-installation\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Linux Installation | Rapid7 Agent Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"This article guides you through this installation process for the Rapid7 Agent (Insight Agent) on Linux.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insight-agent/linux-installation/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"- Linux Installation\"},{\"name\":\"sh-installer\",\"route\":\"/insight-agent/sh-installer\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\".sh Installer (No Longer Supported) | Rapid7 Agent Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"See this article for information regarding the .sh Rapid7 Agent (Insight Agent) installer.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insight-agent/sh-installer/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"HIDDEN\"},{\"name\":\"endpoint-prevention-install\",\"route\":\"/insight-agent/endpoint-prevention-install\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Install Endpoint Prevention | Rapid7 Agent Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"This article contains an overview of the available add-ons that provide Endpoint Prevention capabilities for your organization.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insight-agent/endpoint-prevention-install/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Endpoint Prevention\"},{\"name\":\"rp-install\",\"route\":\"/insight-agent/rp-install\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Install Ransomware Prevention | Rapid7 Agent Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"This article provides a walkthrough of the Ransomware Prevention add-on installation process.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insight-agent/rp-install/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"- Ransomware Prevention\"},{\"name\":\"ngav-install\",\"route\":\"/insight-agent/ngav-install\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Install Next-Generation Antivirus | Rapid7 Agent Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"This article provides a walkthrough of the Next-Generation Antivirus add-on installation process.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insight-agent/ngav-install/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"- Next-Generation Antivirus\"},{\"name\":\"installation-options\",\"route\":\"/insight-agent/installation-options\",\"frontMatter\":{\"tit