on-assisted-patching/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"- IBM BigFix - Automation-Assisted Patching\"},{\"name\":\"---5\",\"type\":\"separator\",\"title\":\"Sites\"},{\"name\":\"what-is-a-site\",\"route\":\"/insightvm/what-is-a-site\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"What is a site? | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"A site is a collection of assets that are targeted for a scan. Create a site to run a scan of your environment and find vulnerabilities.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insightvm/what-is-a-site/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"What is a site?\"},{\"name\":\"creating-your-first-site\",\"route\":\"/insightvm/creating-your-first-site\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Creating your first site | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"Best practices for logging in and creating your first Site using InsightVM.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insightvm/creating-your-first-site/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Creating your first site\"},{\"name\":\"site-creation-use-cases\",\"route\":\"/insightvm/site-creation-use-cases\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Site creation use cases | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"Select a template, assets, and configuration options then customize your site to suit your specific goal.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insightvm/site-creation-use-cases/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Site creation use cases\"},{\"name\":\"creating-and-editing-sites\",\"route\":\"/insightvm/creating-and-editing-sites\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Create and Edit Sites | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"Create and configure your first basic site.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insightvm/creating-and-editing-sites/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Create and edit sites\"},{\"name\":\"giving-users-access-to-a-site\",\"route\":\"/insightvm/giving-users-access-to-a-site\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Giving users access to a site | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"Control which users have access to sites based on their responsibilities.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insightvm/giving-users-access-to-a-site/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Giving users access to a site\"},{\"name\":\"adding-assets-to-sites\",\"route\":\"/insightvm/adding-assets-to-sites\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Adding assets to sites | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"Assign assets to sites so that they can be scanned.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insightvm/adding-assets-to-sites/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Adding assets to sites\"},{\"name\":\"best-practices-for-adding-assets\",\"route\":\"/insightvm/best-practices-for-adding-assets\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Best practices for adding assets | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"Consider these best practices when adding assets.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insightvm/best-practices-for-adding-assets/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Best practices for adding assets\"},{\"name\":\"deleting-sites\",\"route\":\"/insightvm/deleting-sites\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Deleting sites | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"Manage disk space and ensure data integrity of scan results by deleting unused sites.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insightvm/deleting-sites/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Deleting sites\"},{\"name\":\"site-detail-view\",\"route\":\"/insightvm/site-detail-view\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Site Detail View | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"Open a site's detail view to examine a variety of site data points and functions.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insightvm/site-detail-view/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Site Detail View\"},{\"name\":\"---6\",\"type\":\"separator\",\"title\":\"Scan Engines\"},{\"name\":\"selecting-a-scan-engine-for-a-site\",\"route\":\"/insightvm/selecting-a-scan-engine-for-a-site\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Scan Engines | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"Learn about the different types of Scan Engines that the Security Console can use.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insightvm/selecting-a-scan-engine-for-a-site/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Scan Engines\"},{\"name\":\"configuring-distributed-scan-engines\",\"route\":\"/insightvm/configuring-distributed-scan-engines\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Distributed Scan Engines | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"Read this article to learn about and deploy distributed Scan Engines.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insightvm/configuring-distributed-scan-engines/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Distributed Scan Engines\"},{\"name\":\"post-installation-engine-to-console-pairing\",\"route\":\"/insightvm/post-installation-engine-to-console-pairing\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Post-Installation Engine-to-Console Pairing | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"Read this article if you need instructions on how to reverse pair a Scan Engine that you've already deployed to your Security Console.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insightvm/post-installation-engine-to-console-pairing/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Post-Installation Engine-to-Console Pairing\"},{\"name\":\"pairing-a-hosted-scan-engine\",\"route\":\"/insightvm/pairing-a-hosted-scan-engine\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"External Scanning Service | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"If you've been provisioned a Scan Engine by Rapid7 through the External Scanning Service, read this article to learn how to complete the pairing.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insightvm/pairing-a-hosted-scan-engine/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"External Scanning Service\"},{\"name\":\"working-with-scan-engine-pools\",\"route\":\"/insightvm/working-with-scan-engine-pools\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Scan Engine Pools | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"Learn how you can pool Scan Engines together to handle large scanning tasks.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insightvm/working-with-scan-engine-pools/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Scan Engine Pools\"},{\"name\":\"containerized-scan-engine\",\"route\":\"/insightvm/containerized-scan-engine\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Containerized Scan Engine | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"Read this article to learn about Scan Engine Containerization.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insightvm/containerized-scan-engine/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Containerized Scan Engine\"},{\"name\":\"headless-scan-engine\",\"route\":\"/insightvm/headless-scan-engine\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Headless Scan Engine | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"Learn how to utilize the Headless Scan Engine in your environment.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insightvm/headless-scan-engine/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"HIDDEN\"},{\"name\":\"azure-scan-engine\",\"route\":\"/insightvm/azure-scan-engine\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Azure Scan Engines | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"Learn how to deploy a Scan Engine as an Azure Virtual Machine.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insightvm/azure-scan-engine/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Azure Scan Engines\"},{\"name\":\"scan-engine-communication-methods\",\"route\":\"/insightvm/scan-engine-communication-methods\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Scan Engine Communication Methods | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"Learn about the different ways a Scan Engine can communicate with your Security Console.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insightvm/scan-engine-communication-methods/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Scan Engine Communication Methods\"},{\"name\":\"scan-engine-data-collection-rules-and-details\",\"route\":\"/insightvm/scan-engine-data-collection-rules-and-details\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Scan Engine Data Collection - Rules and Details | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"This article contains details on specific scanning scenarios you should be aware of.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insightvm/scan-engine-data-collection-rules-and-details/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Scan Engine Data Collection - Rules and Details\"},{\"name\":\"scan-engine-management-on-the-insight-platform\",\"route\":\"/insightvm/scan-engine-management-on-the-insight-platform\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Scan Engine Management on the Command Platform (Insight Platform) | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"Pair your Scan Engines to the Command Platform (Insight Platform) for health monitoring, telemetry features, and validation scanning.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insightvm/scan-engine-management-on-the-insight-platform/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Scan Engine Management on the Command Platform (Insight Platform)\"},{\"name\":\"enhanced-vulnerability-detection-for-multinic-assets\",\"route\":\"/insightvm/enhanced-vulnerability-detection-for-multinic-assets\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Enhanced vulnerability detection for Multi-NIC assets | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"Learn about Multiple Network Interface Cards assets and vulnerability detection.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insightvm/enhanced-vulnerability-detection-for-multinic-assets/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"HIDDEN\"},{\"name\":\"---7\",\"type\":\"separator\",\"title\":\"Scan Templates\"},{\"name\":\"selecting-a-scan-template\",\"route\":\"/insightvm/selecting-a-scan-template\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Selecting a scan template | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"Use scan templates for different types of assets, purposes, and situations.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insightvm/selecting-a-scan-template/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Selecting a scan template\"},{\"name\":\"scan-template-best-practices\",\"route\":\"/insightvm/scan-template-best-practices\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Scan Template Best Practices | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"A scan template is a predefined set of scan attributes that you can select quickly rather than manually define properties, such as target assets, services, and vulnerabilities. We recommend setting up a Best Practice scan template in the Security Console.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insightvm/scan-template-best-practices/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Scan template best practices\"},{\"name\":\"scanning-with-multiple-templates\",\"route\":\"/insightvm/scanning-with-multiple-templates\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Scanning with multiple templates | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"Use multiple templates in your scan configuration to refine your vulnerability results.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insightvm/scanning-with-multiple-templates/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Scanning with multiple templates\"},{\"name\":\"scan-templates\",\"route\":\"/insightvm/scan-templates\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Scan templates appendix | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"Learn about the different built-in scan templates that Vulnerability Management (InsightVM) supports.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insightvm/scan-templates/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Scan templates appendix\"},{\"name\":\"authenticated-discovery-scans\",\"route\":\"/insightvm/authenticated-discovery-scans\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Authenticated Discovery Scans | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"Enable this authentication feature on your discovery scan templates to improve operating system, software, and service fingerprinting on target assets.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insightvm/authenticated-discovery-scans/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Authenticated Discovery Scans\"},{\"name\":\"---8\",\"type\":\"separator\",\"title\":\"Scan Credentials\"},{\"name\":\"configuring-scan-credentials\",\"route\":\"/insightvm/configuring-scan-credentials\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Configuring scan credentials | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"Learn about the types of credentials.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insightvm/configuring-scan-credentials/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Configuring scan credentials\"},{\"name\":\"maximizing-security-with-credentials\",\"route\":\"/insightvm/maximizing-security-with-credentials\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Maximizing security with credentials | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"Best practices for maximizing your security with credentials.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insightvm/maximizing-security-with-credentials/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Maximizing security with credentials\"},{\"name\":\"configuring-site-specific-scan-credentials\",\"route\":\"/insightvm/configuring-site-specific-scan-credentials\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Configuring site-specific scan credentials | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"Set up or edit existing test credentials for a site. Restrict credentials to a specific asset or port.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insightvm/configuring-site-specific-scan-credentials/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Configuring site-specific scan credentials\"},{\"name\":\"managing-shared-scan-credentials\",\"route\":\"/insightvm/managing-shared-scan-credentials\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Managing shared scan credentials | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"Learn about managing scan credentials\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insightvm/managing-shared-scan-credentials/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Managing shared scan credentials\"},{\"name\":\"creating-and-managing-cyberark-credentials\",\"route\":\"/insightvm/creating-and-managing-cyberark-credentials\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Creating and Managing CyberArk Credentials | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"Create and configure a credentialed scan with CyberArk as the authentication source.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insightvm/creating-and-managing-cyberark-credentials/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Creating and Managing CyberArk Credentials\"},{\"name\":\"kerberos-credentials-for-authenticated-scans\",\"route\":\"/insightvm/kerberos-credentials-for-authenticated-scans\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Kerberos Credentials for Authenticated Scans | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"Create and configure a credentialed scan with Kerberos network as the authentication source.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insightvm/kerberos-credentials-for-authenticated-scans/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Kerberos Credentials for Authenticated Scans\"},{\"name\":\"using-ssh-public-key-authentication\",\"route\":\"/insightvm/using-ssh-public-key-authentication\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Using SSH public key authentication | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"This article covers how to deploy SSH public key authentication for credentialed scanning.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insightvm/using-ssh-public-key-authentication/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Using SSH public key authentication\"},{\"name\":\"elevating-permissions\",\"route\":\"/insightvm/elevating-permissions\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Elevating permissions | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"Elevate scan engine permissions to administrative or root access, which is required for obtaining certain data.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insightvm/elevating-permissions/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Elevating permissions\"},{\"name\":\"database-credential-requirements-for-scanning-policies\",\"route\":\"/insightvm/database-credential-requirements-for-scanning-policies\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Database scanning credential requirements | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"This page contains information on the necessary credentials required for scanning different types of databases.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insightvm/database-credential-requirements-for-scanning-policies/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Database scanning credential requirements\"},{\"name\":\"using-lmntlm-hash-authentication\",\"route\":\"/insightvm/using-lmntlm-hash-authentication\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Using LM/NTLM hash authentication | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"Pass LM and NTLM hashes for authentication on target Windows or Linux CIFS/SMB services.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insightvm/using-lmntlm-hash-authentication/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Using LM/NTLM hash authentication\"},{\"name\":\"authentication-on-windows-best-practices\",\"route\":\"/insightvm/authentication-on-windows-best-practices\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Authentication on Windows: best practices | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"Best practices for authentication on Windows.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insightvm/authentication-on-windows-best-practices/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Authentication on Windows: best practices\"},{\"name\":\"authentication-on-unix-and-related-targets-best-practices\",\"route\":\"/insightvm/authentication-on-unix-and-related-targets-best-practices\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Authentication on Unix and related targets: best practices | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"Best practices for authentication on Unix and related targets.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insightvm/authentication-on-unix-and-related-targets-best-practices/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Authentication on Unix and related targets: best practices\"},{\"name\":\"using-powershell-with-your-scans\",\"route\":\"/insightvm/using-powershell-with-your-scans\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Using PowerShell with your scans | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"Manage and automate scans with PowerShell.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insightvm/using-powershell-with-your-scans/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Using PowerShell with your scans\"},{\"name\":\"---9\",\"type\":\"separator\",\"title\":\"Scan Assistant\"},{\"name\":\"scan-assistant\",\"route\":\"/insightvm/scan-assistant\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Using the Scan Assistant | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"Brief overview of the scan assistant and how it works.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insightvm/scan-assistant/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"HIDDEN\"},{\"name\":\"scan-assistant-linux\",\"route\":\"/insightvm/scan-assistant-linux\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Using the Scan Assistant for Linux | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"Install and use the Scan Assistant for Linux to scan using a secure connection between assets and the scan engine without the need for scan credential management.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insightvm/scan-assistant-linux/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"HIDDEN\"},{\"name\":\"scan-assistant-combined\",\"route\":\"/insightvm/scan-assistant-combined\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Using the Scan Assistant | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"Overview of the Scan Assistant and how it works for Linux and Windows.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/insightvm/scan-assistant-combined/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Using the Scan Assistant\"},{\"name\":\"---1