 supports.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/nexpose/finding-out-what-features-your-license-supports-1/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Finding out what features your license supports\"},{\"name\":\"---22\",\"type\":\"separator\",\"title\":\"End-of-life Announcements\"},{\"name\":\"legacy-risk-strategies-end-of-life-announcement\",\"route\":\"/nexpose/legacy-risk-strategies-end-of-life-announcement\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Legacy Risk Strategies End-of-Life Announcement | Nexpose Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"End of Life announcement for Legacy Risk Strategies\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/nexpose/legacy-risk-strategies-end-of-life-announcement/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Legacy Risk Strategies\"},{\"name\":\"microsoft-defender-byol-integration-end-of-life-announcement\",\"route\":\"/nexpose/microsoft-defender-byol-integration-end-of-life-announcement\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Microsoft Defender BYOL integration End-of-Life announcement | Nexpose Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"This article covers the End-of-Life announcement for the Microsoft Defender BYOL integration.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/nexpose/microsoft-defender-byol-integration-end-of-life-announcement/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Microsoft Defender BYOL integration End-of-Life announcement\"},{\"name\":\"beyondtrust-privilege-identity-end-of-life-announcement\",\"route\":\"/nexpose/beyondtrust-privilege-identity-end-of-life-announcement\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"BeyondTrust (Previously Liberman) Privileged Identity End-of-Life announcement | Nexpose Documentation\",\"excerpt\":\"This article covers the End-of-Life announcement of BeyondTrust Privileged Identity.\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/nexpose/beyondtrust-privilege-identity-end-of-life-announcement/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"BeyondTrust (Previously Liberman) Privileged Identity End-of-Life announcement\"},{\"name\":\"manage-engine-service-desk-l