 includes several improvements and fixes.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Rapid7 Agent Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insight-agent/20211122/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Rapid7 Agent Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20211210\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insight-agent/20211210\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-12-10\",\"version\":\"3.1.2.35\",\"description\":\"This release includes 2 new components for the Insight Agent and a fix for a Local Privilege Escalation vulnerability.\",\"title\":\"New | Rapid7 Agent Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insight-agent/20211210/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | Rapid7 Agent Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20211212\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insight-agent/20211212\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-12-12\",\"version\":\"3.1.2.36\",\"description\":\"This release includes updates to data collection to support vulnerability coverage checks for Log4j JAR files.\",\"title\":\"New | Rapid7 Agent Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insight-agent/20211212/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | Rapid7 Agent Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20211217\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insight-agent/20211217\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-12-17\",\"version\":\"3.1.2.38\",\"description\":\"This release includes updates to data collection to support vulnerability coverage checks for Log4j JAR files on Windows.\",\"title\":\"New | Rapid7 Agent Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insight-agent/20211217/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | Rapid7 Agent Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20220119\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insight-agent/20220119\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2022-01-19\",\"version\":\"3.1.3\",\"description\":\"This release includes new data collection for Microsoft Patch Tuesday content for December and January, an improvement, a fix, and a security update.\",\"title\":\"New | Rapid7 Agent Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insight-agent/20220119/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | Rapid7 Agent Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20220124\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insight-agent/20220124\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2022-01-24\",\"version\":\"3.1.3.78\",\"description\":\"This release allows the Insight Agent to detect JNDILookup.class file removal.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Rapid7 Agent Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insight-agent/20220124/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Rapid7 Agent Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20220218\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insight-agent/20220218\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2022-02-18\",\"version\":\"3.1.3.79\",\"description\":\"This release includes new data collection for Microsoft Patch Tuesday content for February, and an improvement.\",\"title\":\"New | Rapid7 Agent Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insight-agent/20220218/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | Rapid7 Agent Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20220225\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insight-agent/20220225\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2022-02-25\",\"version\":\"3.1.3.80\",\"description\":\"This release includes a security update and allows the Insight Agent to find Log4j version 1.x JAR files.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Rapid7 Agent Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insight-agent/20220225/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Rapid7 Agent Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20220318\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insight-agent/20220318\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2022-03-18\",\"version\":\"3.1.4\",\"description\":\"This release includes new data collection for Microsoft Patch Tuesday content for March 2022, an improvement, and a few fixes.\",\"title\":\"New | Rapid7 Agent Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/rele