nect/page/8\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Automation Release Notes - Page 8\",\"description\":\"Release notes for Automation - Page 8\"},\"title\":\"Automation Release Notes - Page 8\"},{\"name\":\"9\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightconnect/page/9\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Automation Release Notes - Page 9\",\"description\":\"Release notes for Automation - Page 9\"},\"title\":\"Automation Release Notes - Page 9\"}],\"title\":\"Page\"}],\"title\":\"Insightconnect\"},{\"name\":\"insightidr\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightidr\",\"children\":[{\"name\":\"index\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightidr\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"SIEM Release Notes - Page 1\",\"description\":\"Release notes for SIEM - Page 1\"},\"title\":\"SIEM Release Notes - Page 1\"},{\"name\":\"20200930\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightidr/20200930\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2020-09-30\",\"version\":\"20200930\",\"description\":\"In this release we've got a new monthly log data usage chart, Insight Agent log collection, the ability to add up to 5 fields to a single query, plus several improvements and fixes.\",\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightidr/20200930/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20201030\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightidr/20201030\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2020-10-30\",\"version\":\"20201030\",\"description\":\"In this release, we introduced Enhanced Endpoint Telemetry, improved filtering in Log Search, and fixed some issues.\",\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightidr/20201030/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20201130\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightidr/20201130\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2020-11-30\",\"version\":\"20201130\",\"description\":\"This release includes new custom parser functionality and support for three new event sources.\",\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightidr/20201130/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20201228\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightidr/20201228\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2020-12-28\",\"version\":\"20201228\",\"description\":\"This release includes updates to InsightIDR settings and custom parsing tool improvements.\",\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightidr/20201228/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20210128\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightidr/20210128\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-01-28\",\"version\":\"20210128\",\"description\":\"This release includes updates to the InsightIDR Detection Library, Hash Reputation Enrichment and Asset Details page.\",\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightidr/20210128/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20210225\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightidr/20210225\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-02-25\",\"version\":\"20210225\",\"description\":\"This release includes support for the Google Cloud Platform event source and new LEQL functionality.\",\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightidr/20210225/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20210401\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightidr/20210401\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-04-01\",\"version\":\"20210401\",\"description\":\"This release includes a new category for ingress events and functionality updates to the User Watchlist page.\",\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightidr/20210401/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20210430\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightidr/20210430\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-04-30\",\"version\":\"20210430\",\"description\":\"This release includes updates to the Duo Security event source, Entry Inspector, and Investigations Timeline, as well as improvements to Network Sensor Health.\",\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightidr/20210430/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20210527\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightidr/20210527\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-05-27\",\"version\":\"20210527\",\"description\":\"This release includes new parsing support for Microsoft Azure and updates to the Exploits page, IP Addresses tables and a new classification for SharePoint admins.\",\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightidr/20210527/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20210701\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightidr/20210701\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-07-01\",\"version\":\"20210701\",\"description\":\"This release includes a new InsightIDR dark mode feature, new user pages for active and disabled users, and updates to the dashboards and reports.\",\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightidr/20210701/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20210802\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightidr/20210802\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-08-02\",\"version\":\"20210802\",\"description\":\"This release includes a new Auth0 Event Source, updates to our LEQL search queries, Alerts and language.\",\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightidr/20210802/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20210908\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightidr/20210908\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-09-08\",\"version\":\"20210908\",\"description\":\"This release includes a unified Alert Settings experience, Event Source Health Monitoring, global Dashboard filtering and updates to Log Search.\",\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightidr/20210908/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20211005\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightidr/20211005\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-10-05\",\"version\":\"20211005\",\"description\":\"This release includes MITRE ATT\u0026CK mapping views and Attacker Behavior Analytics process and Command Line Detection Rules.\",\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightidr/20211005/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20211101\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightidr/20211101\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-11-01\",\"version\":\"20211101\",\"description\":\"This release includes our new copy investigation evidence to exception rule feature, improvements to log line attribution, and mixed quote support.\",\"title\":\"Coming soon | SIEM Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightidr/20211101/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Coming soon | SIEM Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20211201\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightidr/20211201\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-12-01\",\"version\":\"20211201\",\"description\":\"This release includes our new rule priority for UBA detection rules, newly improved Assets Details page, and improvements to search performance speeds in Log Search.\",\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightidr/20211201/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20211217\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightidr/20211217\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-12-17\",\"version\":\"20211217\",\"description\":\"This release includes our new rule priority for custom alerts, Dashboard chart captions, Rapid7 Resource Names (RRNs) and improvements to User Interface (UI) color palette.\",\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightidr/20211217/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20220126\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightidr/20220126\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2022-01-26\",\"version\":\"20220126\",\"description\":\"This release includes our new Quick Action feature, chart color customization, and improvements to Investigation Details.\",\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightidr/20220126/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20220228\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightidr/20220228\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2022-02-28\",\"version\":\"20220228\",\"description\":\"This release includes our new ABA Amazon GuardDuty detections, our new syntax highlighting feature, and updates to the Insight Network Sensor.\",\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightidr/20220228/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20220330\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightidr/20220330\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2022-03-30\",\"version\":\"20220330\",\"description\":\"This release includes a new integration with Threat Command, additions to the IDS Network Sensor's ruleset, and an update to Custom Alert queries. \",\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightidr/20220330/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20220428\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightidr/20220428\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2022-04-28\",\"version\":\"20220428\",\"description\":\"This InsightIDR release includes a new log collection method, improvements to rule changes for ABA Detection Rules, and contextual Quick Actions explorations with Log Search results. \",\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightidr/20220428/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20220527\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightidr/20220527\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2022-05-27\",\"version\":\"20220527\",\"description\":\"This release includes new MDR customer control over ABA Detection Rules, HTML report generation in InsightIDR, improvements to syntax highlighting and the Log Search context menu, and an overall boost to system performance.\",\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightidr/20220527/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20220629\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightidr/20220629\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2022-06-29\",\"version\":\"20220629\",\"description\":\"This release includes the new Relative Activity Score for Attacker Behavior Analytics (ABA) detection rules, improvements to the Log Search UI and viewing permissions, and added support for multiple event source parsers.\",\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightidr/20220629/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20220729\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightidr/20220729\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2022-07-29\",\"version\":\"20220729\",\"description\":\"This release includes the new InsightConnect automation workflow triggered by ABA detection rules and a new detection rule for Anomalous Data Transfer (ADT).\",\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightidr/20220729/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20220831\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightidr/20220831\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2022-08-31\",\"version\":\"20220831\",\"description\":\"This release includes new 360° XDR with InsightIDR + Threat Command, a new Exception Preview for ABA detection rules, and extended syntax highlighting features.\",\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightidr/20220831/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20220930\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightidr/20220930\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2022-09-30\",\"version\":\"20220930\",\"description\":\"This release includes new logs in the Endpoint Activity log set, improved maintenance notifications, and additional support for Microsoft Azure Active Directory admin activity.\",\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightidr/20220930/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20221028\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightidr/20221028\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2022-10-28\",\"version\":\"20221028\",\"description\":\"This InsightIDR release includes new Log Search documentation, multiple new event sources and improvements to the Webhook Data Exporter.\",\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightidr/20221028/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20221130\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightidr/20221130\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2022-11-30\",\"version\":\"20221130\",\"description\":\"This InsightIDR release includes new Cisco Meraki Cloud API Support and improvements to Log Search's groupby function.\",\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightidr/20221130/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20221227\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightidr/20221227\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2022-12-27\",\"version\":\"20221227\",\"description\":\"This release includes enhancements to Investigations for Managed Detection and Response customers and new functionality in Dashboards and Reports.\",\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightidr/20221227/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20230131\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightidr/20230131\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2023-01-31\",\"version\":\"20230131\",\"description\":\"This release includes the addition of an audit log to Investigations, a new API collection method for Palo Alto Cortex Data Lake, and MDR access to the Onboarding Progress Tracker.\",\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightidr/20230131/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20230228\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightidr/20230228\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2023-02-28\",\"version\":\"20230228\",\"description\":\"This release includes a new API collection method for SentinelOne EDR, new ABA Detection rules and updates to Log search open preview.\",\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightidr/20230228/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20230331\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightidr/20230331\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2023-03-31\",\"version\":\"20230331\",\"description\":\"This release includes new ABA Detection rules and updates to Log Search Open Preview.\",\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightidr/20230331/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20230428\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightidr/20230428\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2023-04-28\",\"version\":\"20230428\",\"description\":\"This release includes new features in Log Search Open Preview, Detection Library updates and improvements in Investigations and Event Sources.\",\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightidr/20230428/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20230531\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightidr/20230531\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2023-05-31\",\"version\":\"20230531\",\"description\":\"This release includes new features in Log Search Open Preview, access to the multi-customer experience for MSSPs, LEQL exceptions, and improvements to event sources.\",\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightidr/20230531/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20230630\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightidr/20230630\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2023-06-30\",\"version\":\"20230630\",\"description\":\"This release includes new features in Log Search Open Preview and enhanced details for alerts in investigations\",\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightidr/20230630/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20230731\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightidr/20230731\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2023-07-31\",\"version\":\"20230731\",\"description\":\"This release includes updates to Log Search, new event sources, and improvements to the Investigations experience.\",\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightidr/20230731/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20230831\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightidr/20230831\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2023-08-31\",\"version\":\"20230831\",\"description\":\"This release includes Custom Detection Rules, new detection rules, and improvements to event sources.\",\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightidr/20230831/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20230929\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightidr/20230929\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2023-09-29\",\"version\":\"20230929\",\"description\":\"This release includes additions to the Log Search experience, a new rule action for detection rules, and improvements to Investigations.\",\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightidr/20230929/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20231030\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightidr/20231030\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2023-10-30\",\"version\":\"20231030\",\"description\":\"This release includes additions to dashboard visualizations, Sentinel One EDR's injection support, and improvements to Log Search.\",\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightidr/20231030/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20231130\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightidr/20231130\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2023-11-30\",\"version\":\"20231130\",\"description\":\"This release includes includes the addition of InsightConnect Quick Actions to Log Search, a detection rule migration, and several updates to event source data parsing.\",\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightidr/20231130/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20231219\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightidr/20231219\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2023-12-19\",\"version\":\"20231219\",\"description\":\"This release includes response actions powered by InsightConnect, new connection points between Investigations and Log Search, and updates to event source parsing.\",\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightidr/20231219/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20240131\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightidr/20240131\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2024-01-31\",\"version\":\"20240131\",\"description\":\"This release includes updates to event parsing and general improvements across the product.\",\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightidr/20240131/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20240229\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightidr/20240229\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2024-02-29\",\"version\":\"20240229\",\"description\":\"This InsightIDR release includes a new filter when you create an event source, the application of role-based access controls to certain Log Search functionalities, and readability improvements to the user interface. \",\"title\":\"Improved | SIEM Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightidr/20240229/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | SIEM Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20240329\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightidr/20240329\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2024-03-29\",\"version\":\"20240329\",\"description\":\"This InsightIDR release includes updates to the Log Search query bar and improvements to the honeypot OVA and AMI.\",\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightidr/20240329/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20240430\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightidr/20240430\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2024-04-30\",\"version\":\"20240430\",\"description\":\"This InsightIDR release includes new Cloud event source capabilities, new pre-computed query functionality, and improvements across the InsightIDR interface.\",\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightidr/20240430/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20240531\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightidr/20240531\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2024-05-31\",\"version\":\"20240531\",\"description\":\"This InsightIDR release includes improvements to deleting variables, limit configuration, grouping results in Log search, as well as various fixes.\",\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightidr/20240531/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20240628\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightidr/20240628\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2024-06-28\",\"version\":\"20240628\",\"description\":\"This InsightIDR release includes an update to Event Source email notifications, new filter options in Log Search, a new time range picker in Log Search, access to pre-computed queries, as well as various improvements and fixes.\",\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightidr/20240628/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20240731\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightidr/20240731\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2024-07-31\",\"version\":\"20240731\",\"description\":\"This InsightIDR release includes a new event source, as well as improvements to Admin Activity and User Details.\",\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightidr/20240731/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20240830\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightidr/20240830\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2024-08-30\",\"version\":\"20240830\",\"description\":\"This InsightIDR release includes proactive key suggestions, linking from notable events to evidence in logs, as well as various improvements and fixes.\",\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightidr/20240830/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20240930\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightidr/20240930\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2024-09-30\",\"version\":\"20240930\",\"description\":\"This InsightIDR release includes a help docs link in the Universal Webhook Data Exporter, pre-computed queries as default when building dashboard cards, pre-computed queries accessible from Log search home tab, as well as various improvements and fixes. \",\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightidr/20240930/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20241031\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightidr/20241031\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2024-10-31\",\"version\":\"20241031\",\"description\":\"This InsightIDR release includes new cloud event sources, improvements to the WinMonitorLog data source, as well as various improvements and fixes. \",\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightidr/20241031/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20241129\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightidr/20241129\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2024-11-29\",\"version\":\"20241129\",\"description\":\"This InsightIDR release includes updates to the Watchguard XTM event source, Log Search, and new cloud event sources, as well as various improvements and fixes.\",\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightidr/20241129/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20241220\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightidr/20241220\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2024-12-20\",\"version\":\"20241220\",\"description\":\"This InsightIDR release includes updates to SentinelOne, Crowdstrike, Okta, Bitdefender, and Palo Alto Networks event sources. It also includes various improvements and fixes.\",\"title\":\"Improved | SIEM Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightidr/20241220/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | SIEM Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20250131\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightidr/20250131\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2025-01-31\",\"version\":\"20250131\",\"description\":\"This InsightIDR release includes improvements to various event sources and to the UI. It also includes multiple fixes.\",\"title\":\"Improved | SIEM Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightidr/20250131/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | SIEM Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20250331\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightidr/20250331\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2025-03-31\",\"version\":\"20250331\",\"description\":\"This InsightIDR release includes new ABA detection rules, improvements to event sources, and several fixes.\",\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightidr/20250331/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20250430\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightidr/20250430\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2025-04-30\",\"version\":\"20250430\",\"description\":\"This InsightIDR release includes new ABA detection rules, as well as various improvements and fixes.\",\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightidr/20250430/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | SIEM Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20250523\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightidr/20250523\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2025-05-23\",\"description\":\"This document is no longer updated as of May 23, 2025. Read new release notes in the Command Platform Help.\",\"title\":\"release-notes-idr-eol-notice | SIEM Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightidr/20250523/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"release-notes-idr-eol-notice | SIEM Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"page\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightidr/page\",\"children\":[{\"name\":\"2\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightidr/page/2\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"SIEM Release Notes - Page 2\",\"description\":\"Release notes for SIEM - Page 2\"},\"title\":\"SIEM Release Notes - Page 2\"},{\"name\":\"3\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightidr/page/3\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"SIEM Release Notes - Page 3\",\"description\":\"Release notes for SIEM - Page 3\"},\"title\":\"SIEM Release Notes - Page 3\"},{\"name\":\"4\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightidr/page/4\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"SIEM Release Notes - Page 4\",\"description\":\"Release notes for SIEM - Page 4\"},\"title\":\"SIEM Release Notes - Page 4\"},{\"name\":\"5\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightidr/page/5\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"SIEM Release Notes - Page 5\",\"description\":\"Release notes for SIEM - Page 5\"},\"title\":\"SIEM Release Notes - Page 5\"},{\"name\":\"6\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightidr/page/6\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"SIEM Release Notes - Page 6\",\"description\":\"Release notes for SIEM - Page 6\"},\"title\":\"SIEM Release Notes - Page 6\"}],\"title\":\"Page\"}],\"title\":\"Insightidr\"},{\"name\":\"insightnetworksensor\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightnetworksensor\",\"children\":[{\"name\":\"index\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightnetworksensor\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Rapid7 Network Sensor Release Notes - Page 1\",\"description\":\"Release notes for Rapid7 Network Sensor - Page 1\"},\"title\":\"Rapid7 Network Sensor Release Notes - Page 1\"},{\"name\":\"20200903\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightnetworksensor/20200903\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2020-09-03\",\"version\":\"1.1.4.3\",\"description\":\"In this release we've added support for sensor deployments on AWS and Xen hypervisors, as well as DHCP decoder enhancements for device fingerprinting.\",\"title\":\"New | Rapid7 Network Sensor Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightnetworksensor/20200903/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | Rapid7 Network Sensor Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20200908\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightnetworksensor/20200908\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2020-09-08\",\"version\":\"1.1.4.4\",\"description\":\"This release includes beta support for HyperV installations.\",\"title\":\"New | Rapid7 Network Sensor Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightnetworksensor/20200908/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | Rapid7 Network Sensor Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20201019\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightnetworksensor/20201019\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2020-10-19\",\"version\":\"1.1.5.1\",\"description\":\"In this release we introduced Receive Slide Scaling support and added a NetBios name service detection.\",\"title\":\"New | Rapid7 Network Sensor Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightnetworksensor/20201019/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | Rapid7 Network Sensor Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20201130\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightnetworksensor/20201130\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2020-11-30\",\"version\":\"1.1.5.3\",\"description\":\"This release includes new support for AWS VPC Traffic Mirroring.\",\"title\":\"New | Rapid7 Network Sensor Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightnetworksensor/20201130/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | Rapid7 Network Sensor Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20210511\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightnetworksensor/20210511\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-05-11\",\"version\":\"1.1.5.8\",\"description\":\"This version of the Insight Network Sensor adds support for Google Cloud Platform deployments!\",\"title\":\"New | Rapid7 Network Sensor Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightnetworksensor/20210511/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | Rapid7 Network Sensor Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20210621\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightnetworksensor/20210621\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-06-21\",\"version\":\"1.1.8.5\",\"description\":\"This version of the Insight Network Sensor enables Receive Side Scaling on suitable hardware deployments for better performance.\",\"title\":\"New | Rapid7 Network Sensor Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightnetworksensor/20210621/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | Rapid7 Network Sensor Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20210825\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightnetworksensor/20210825\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-08-25\",\"version\":\"1.2.1.1\",\"description\":\"This version of the Insight Network Sensor delivers further performance improvements.\",\"title\":\"New | Rapid7 Network Sensor Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightnetworksensor/20210825/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | Rapid7 Network Sensor Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20211117\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightnetworksensor/20211117\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-11-17\",\"version\":\"1.2.2.0\",\"description\":\"New NIC statistics in sensor management plus support for GRE encapsulated traffic mirroring on VMWare \",\"title\":\"New | Rapid7 Network Sensor Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightnetworksensor/20211117/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | Rapid7 Network Sensor Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20220228\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightnetworksensor/20220228\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2022-02-28\",\"version\":\"1.2.2.2\",\"description\":\"We updated the sensor management experience and fixed several bugs.\",\"title\":\"New | Rapid7 Network Sensor Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightnetworksensor/20220228/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | Rapid7 Network Sensor Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20220509\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightnetworksensor/20220509\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2022-05-09\",\"version\":\"1.3.0.7\",\"description\":\"Updated Surciata IDS and Insight Network Sensor base OS\",\"title\":\"New | Rapid7 Network Sensor Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightnetworksensor/20220509/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | Rapid7 Network Sensor Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20220707\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightnetworksensor/20220707\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2022-07-07\",\"version\":\"1.4.0.1\",\"description\":\"Added GRETAP and VXLAN Support. Updates to Suricata IDS and Insight Network Sensor base OS.\",\"title\":\"New | Rapid7 Network Sensor Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightnetworksensor/20220707/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | Rapid7 Network Sensor Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20221110\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightnetworksensor/20221110\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2022-11-10\",\"version\":\"1.4.0.2\",\"description\":\"This release updates the OpenSSL component in the Insight Network Sensor container.\",\"title\":\"New | Rapid7 Network Sensor Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightnetworksensor/20221110/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | Rapid7 Network Sensor Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20230130\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightnetworksensor/20230130\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2023-01-30\",\"version\":\"1.5.0.1\",\"description\":\"This release updates the Suricata IDS engine and the Insight Network Sensor base operating system.\",\"title\":\"New | Rapid7 Network Sensor Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightnetworksensor/20230130/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | Rapid7 Network Sensor Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20240702\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightnetworksensor/20240702\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2024-07-02\",\"version\":\"1.6.1.0\",\"description\":\"This release updates the Suricata IDS engine, the Insight Network Sensor's base operating system, and the internal libraries.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Rapid7 Network Sensor Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightnetworksensor/20240702/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Rapid7 Network Sensor Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20250523\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightnetworksensor/20250523\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2025-05-23\",\"description\":\"This document is no longer updated as of May 23, 2025. Read new release notes in the Command Platform Help.\",\"title\":\"release-notes-networksensor-eol-notice | Rapid7 Network Sensor Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightnetworksensor/20250523/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"release-notes-networksensor-eol-notice | Rapid7 Network Sensor Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"page\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightnetworksensor/page\",\"children\":[{\"name\":\"2\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightnetworksensor/page/2\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Rapid7 Network Sensor Release Notes - Page 2\",\"description\":\"Release notes for Rapid7 Network Sensor - Page 2\"},\"title\":\"Rapid7 Network Sensor Release Notes - Page 2\"}],\"title\":\"Page\"}],\"title\":\"Insightnetworksensor\"},{\"name\":\"insightops\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightops\",\"children\":[{\"name\":\"index\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightops\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"InsightOps Release Notes\",\"description\":\"Release notes for InsightOps\"},\"title\":\"InsightOps Release Notes\"},{\"name\":\"20250523\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightops/20250523\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2025-05-23\",\"description\":\"This document is no longer updated as of May 23, 2025. Read new release notes in the Command Platform Help.\",\"title\":\"release-notes-ops-eol-notice | InsightOps Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightops/20250523/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"release-notes-ops-eol-notice | InsightOps Documentation\"}],\"title\":\"Insightops\"},{\"name\":\"insightvm\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightvm\",\"children\":[{\"name\":\"index\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightvm\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Vulnerability Management Release Notes - Page 1\",\"description\":\"Release notes for Vulnerability Management - Page 1\"},\"title\":\"Vulnerability Management Release Notes - Page 1\"},{\"name\":\"20200122\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightvm/20200122\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2020-12-2\",\"version\":\"6.6.55\",\"description\":\"See how your containers are stacking up against our latest Snyk vulnerability content! We've also shipped a new policy and fixed some issues.\",\"title\":\"New | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightvm/20200122/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | Vulnerability Management Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20200129\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightvm/20200129\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2020-12-9\",\"version\":\"6.6.56\",\"description\":\"In addition to delivering Microsoft Patch Tuesday coverage for December 2020, this release also includes feature improvements and fixes.\",\"title\":\"New | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightvm/20200129/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | Vulnerability Management Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20200923\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightvm/20200923\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2020-09-23\",\"version\":\"6.6.44\",\"description\":\"You can now export dashboards as PDFs! Plus, we've updated an Ubuntu Linux policy, improved scan performance, improved fingerprint accuracy, and more!\",\"title\":\"New | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightvm/20200923/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | Vulnerability Management Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20200925\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightvm/20200925\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2020-09-25\",\"version\":\"6.6.45\",\"description\":\"In this release, we fixed an issue with validation scans for Remediation Projects.\",\"title\":\"Fixed | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightvm/20200925/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Fixed | Vulnerability Management Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20200930\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightvm/20200930\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2020-09-30\",\"version\":\"6.6.46\",\"description\":\"In this release we've got updated DISA policy content, improved scan engine performance, and some fixes.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightvm/20200930/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Vulnerability Management Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20201007\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightvm/20201007\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2020-10-07\",\"version\":\"6.6.47\",\"description\":\"Shorten false posititve evaluation times with our new investigation tool shipped in this product version. This release also includes several policy updates and fixes.\",\"title\":\"New | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightvm/20201007/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | Vulnerability Management Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20201008\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightvm/20201008\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2020-10-08\",\"version\":\"6.6.48\",\"description\":\"In this release, we fixed a Security Console-based vulnerability investigation user permission issue.\",\"title\":\"Fixed | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightvm/20201008/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Fixed | Vulnerability Management Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20201014\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightvm/20201014\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2020-10-14\",\"version\":\"6.6.49\",\"description\":\"In this release we've got updated scan coverage for October 2020, plus some improvements and fixes.\",\"title\":\"New | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightvm/20201014/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | Vulnerability Management Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20201021\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightvm/20201021\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2020-10-21\",\"version\":\"6.6.50\",\"description\":\"Try out the new and improved Goals and SLAs wizard in this release.\",\"title\":\"New | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightvm/20201021/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | Vulnerability Management Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20201028\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightvm/20201028\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2020-10-28\",\"version\":\"6.6.51\",\"description\":\"We now support recurring vulnerability coverage for Pulse Connect Secure, and we released a few improvements and fixes.\",\"title\":\"New | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightvm/20201028/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | Vulnerability Management Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20201104\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightvm/20201104\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2020-11-04\",\"version\":\"6.6.52\",\"description\":\"Take advantage of some new scan template optimizations in this release.\",\"title\":\"New | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightvm/20201104/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | Vulnerability Management Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20201111\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightvm/20201111\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2020-11-11\",\"version\":\"6.6.53\",\"description\":\"This release includes Patch Tuesday coverage for November 2020 and a host of improvements and fixes for dashboards and cards.\",\"title\":\"New | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightvm/20201111/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | Vulnerability Management Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20201118\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightvm/20201118\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2020-11-18\",\"version\":\"6.6.54\",\"description\":\"Try our improved reports archive filtering and search capabilities! In addition, this release includes new policy content and general Security Console fixes.\",\"title\":\"New | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightvm/20201118/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | Vulnerability Management Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20201216\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightvm/20201216\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2020-12-16\",\"version\":\"6.6.57\",\"description\":\"This release ships several customer-requested additions and new vulnerability coverage, updates our DISA policy content, and fixes some issues.\",\"title\":\"New | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightvm/20201216/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | Vulnerability Management Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20201229\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightvm/20201229\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2020-12-29\",\"description\":\"This content release contains a new vulnerability check for CVE-2020-10148 affecting the SolarWinds API.\",\"title\":\"New | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightvm/20201229/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | Vulnerability Management Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20210105\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightvm/20210105\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-1-5\",\"description\":\"This content release contains a new vulnerability check for CVE-2020-15505 affecting MobileIron products.\",\"title\":\"New | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightvm/20210105/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | Vulnerability Management Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20210107\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightvm/20210107\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-1-7\",\"version\":\"6.6.58\",\"description\":\"This release only provides installers containing the latest content for offline deployments.\",\"title\":\"release-notes-6.6.58 | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightvm/20210107/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"release-notes-6.6.58 | Vulnerability Management Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20210113\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightvm/20210113\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-1-13\",\"version\":\"6.6.59\",\"description\":\"This release includes Microsoft Patch Tuesday coverage for January 2021, enhances the Scan Engine, and fixes several issues.\",\"title\":\"New | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightvm/20210113/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | Vulnerability Management Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20210120\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightvm/20210120\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-1-20\",\"version\":\"6.6.60\",\"description\":\"This release contains fixes for VMware ESXi scanning scenarios and remediation project generation.\",\"title\":\"Fixes | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightvm/20210120/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Fixes | Vulnerability Management Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20210121\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightvm/20210121\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-1-21\",\"version\":\"6.6.61\",\"description\":\"This release contains a fix for an error that could arise from adjusting Security Console user accounts.\",\"title\":\"Fixes | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightvm/20210121/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Fixes | Vulnerability Management Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20210127\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightvm/20210127\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-1-27\",\"version\":\"6.6.62\",\"description\":\"This release includes new console commands for log time zone configuration and several fixes.\",\"title\":\"New | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightvm/20210127/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | Vulnerability Management Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20210203\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightvm/20210203\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-2-3\",\"version\":\"6.6.63\",\"description\":\"This release expands eligibility for InsightVM Platform Login, adds the beta edition of the new Metasploit Remote Check Service, and fixes some issues.\",\"title\":\"New | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightvm/20210203/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | Vulnerability Management Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20210204\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightvm/20210204\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-2-4\",\"version\":\"6.6.65\",\"description\":\"This release fixes a Security Console startup issue found in version 6.6.64.\",\"title\":\"Fixed | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightvm/20210204/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Fixed | Vulnerability Management Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20210204-1\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightvm/20210204-1\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-2-4\",\"version\":\"6.6.64\",\"description\":\"This release fixes a Security Console startup issue found in version 6.6.63.\",\"title\":\"Fixed | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightvm/20210204-1/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Fixed | Vulnerability Management Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20210210\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightvm/20210210\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-2-10\",\"version\":\"6.6.67\",\"description\":\"This release includes Microsoft Patch Tuesday coverage for February 2021, adds new recurring coverage for VMware, and fixes several issues.\",\"title\":\"New | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightvm/20210210/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | Vulnerability Management Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20210217\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightvm/20210217\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-2-17\",\"version\":\"6.6.68\",\"description\":\"This release includes asset correlation improvements, more filtered asset search criteria, and several APIv3 related fixes.\",\"title\":\"New | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightvm/20210217/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | Vulnerability Management Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20210224\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightvm/20210224\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-2-24\",\"version\":\"6.6.69\",\"description\":\"This release includes asset correlation and software fingerprinting fixes.\",\"title\":\"Fixed | Vulnerability Management Documentation