tation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightvm/20210317/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Vulnerability Management Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20210318\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightvm/20210318\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-3-18\",\"version\":\"6.6.73\",\"description\":\"This release fixes a content loading issue affecting some Scan Engines.\",\"title\":\"Fixed | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightvm/20210318/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Fixed | Vulnerability Management Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20210324\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightvm/20210324\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-3-24\",\"version\":\"6.6.74\",\"description\":\"Along with a few fixes, this release includes new support for ECDSA public key authentication, better database management, and policy updates.\",\"title\":\"New | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightvm/20210324/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | Vulnerability Management Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20210331\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightvm/20210331\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-3-31\",\"version\":\"6.6.75\",\"description\":\"This release ships new and updated vulnerability and policy content (including new checks for Cisco Jabber vulnerabilities) and fixes several issues.\",\"title\":\"New | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightvm/20210331/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | Vulnerability Management Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20210401\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightvm/20210401\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-4-1\",\"version\":\"6.6.76\",\"description\":\"This release fixes a cosmetic issue affecting global search results in the Security Console.\",\"title\":\"Fixed | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"fileP