erface.\",\"title\":\"Fixed | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightvm/20240215/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Fixed | Vulnerability Management Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20240221\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightvm/20240221\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2024-02-21\",\"version\":\"6.6.239\",\"description\":\"This release includes added built-in support, security posture improvements, and a fix.\",\"title\":\"New | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightvm/20240221/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | Vulnerability Management Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20240228\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightvm/20240228\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2024-02-28\",\"version\":\"6.6.240\",\"description\":\"This release includes an improvement related to Tags, improvements for the Maintenance and Backup pages, and a fix.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightvm/20240228/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Vulnerability Management Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20240306\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightvm/20240306\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2024-03-06\",\"version\":\"6.6.241\",\"description\":\"This release includes a security posture improvement.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/insightvm/20240306/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Vulnerability Management Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20240313\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/insightvm/20240313\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2024-03-13\",\"version\":\"6.6.242\",\"description\":\"This release includes new Microsoft Patch Tuesday content for March and added vulnerability checks.\",\"title\":\"New | Vulnerability Management Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/conten