":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20201012/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20201026\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20201026\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2020-10-26\",\"version\":\"4.19.0\",\"description\":\"We made some improvements to the Web App UX experience and updated Metasploit services to use Ruby 2.7.2. This release also fixes several issues.\",\"title\":\"New | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20201026/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20201109\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20201109\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2020-11-09\",\"version\":\"4.19.0\",\"description\":\"We updated the Metasploit Framework content.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20201109/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20201207\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20201207\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2020-12-07\",\"version\":\"4.19.0\",\"description\":\"We fixed issues with Bruteforce Task Chains and Web App export/import. Metasploit Framework content was updated.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20201207/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20210120\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20210120\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-01-20\",\"version\":\"4.19.0\",\"description\":\"We fixed a number of issues, including update (Windows) and restore (Linux). Also UI and cmdline script improvements, plus updated Metasploit content.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20210120/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20210201\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20210201\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-02-01\",\"version\":\"4.19.0\",\"description\":\"We fixed an issue with missing images in generated HTML reports (affecting Windows users), plus updated Metasploit content.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20210201/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20210217\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20210217\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-02-17\",\"version\":\"4.19.0\",\"description\":\"We improved Pro Services stability when using large datasets, plus updated Metasploit content.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20210217/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20210317\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20210317\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-03-17\",\"version\":\"4.19.0\",\"description\":\"We fixed a few issues, plus made some logging improvements. Also added the ability to download backups via the UI and updated Metasploit content.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20210317/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20210329\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20210329\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-03-29\",\"version\":\"4.19.1\",\"description\":\"We added systemd support for Linux installs and made some minor improvements. Also updated several dependencies and Metasploit content.\",\"title\":\"New | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20210329/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20210413\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20210413\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-04-13\",\"version\":\"4.19.1\",\"description\":\"We added new OSes to our supported installation list and fixed an issue with VPN pivot. Also minor improvements and updated Metasploit content.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20210413/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20210426\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20210426\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-04-26\",\"version\":\"4.19.1\",\"description\":\"We updated the Metasploit content.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20210426/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20210511\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20210511\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-05-11\",\"version\":\"4.19.1\",\"description\":\"We fixed an Acunetix XML import issue and updated Metasploit content.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20210511/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20210525\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20210525\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-05-25\",\"version\":\"4.19.1\",\"description\":\"We fixed an issue with SSH login module session replay and updated the Metasploit content.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20210525/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20210607\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20210607\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-06-07\",\"version\":\"4.19.1\",\"description\":\"We fixed a few issues related to viewing API keys and Social Engineering campaigns, and also updated Metasploit content.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20210607/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20210622\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20210622\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-06-22\",\"version\":\"4.19.1\",\"description\":\"We updated the Metasploit Framework with various community fixes.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20210622/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20210708\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20210708\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-07-08\",\"version\":\"4.19.1\",\"description\":\"We fixed a missing logo and added modules for some important issues.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20210708/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20210731\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20210731\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-07-31\",\"version\":\"4.19.1-2021073101\",\"description\":\"We restored console access to the database connection, fixed tagging selections, and enhanced credential imports.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20210731/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20210816\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20210816\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-08-16\",\"version\":\"4.20.0-2021081601\",\"description\":\"We updated Metasploit for Rails 6.1 and included various bug fixes.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20210816/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20210830\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20210830\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-08-30\",\"version\":\"4.20.0-2021083001\",\"description\":\"We added support for users to better determine when to attempt password cracking.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20210830/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20210913\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20210913\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-09-13\",\"version\":\"4.20.0-2021091301\",\"description\":\"We fixed top level wizards that were failing to launch.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20210913/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20210927\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20210927\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-09-27\",\"version\":\"4.20.0-2021092701\",\"description\":\"We updated Metasploit Framework and fixed error reporting when credential files imports fail.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20210927/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20211011\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20211011\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-10-11\",\"version\":\"4.20.0-2021101101\",\"description\":\"We fixed some regressions in functionality related to Social Engineering campaigns.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20211011/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20211025\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20211025\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-10-25\",\"version\":\"4.20.0-2021102501\",\"description\":\"We improved user notifications to display full messages when selected.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20211025/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20211110\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20211110\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-11-10\",\"version\":\"4.20.0-2021111001\",\"description\":\"We corrected a scheduling issue and updated Metasploit Framework.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20211110/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20211120\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20211120\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-11-20\",\"version\":\"4.20.0-2021112001\",\"description\":\"We fixed discovery errors and updated Metasploit Framework\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20211120/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20211206\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20211206\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-12-06\",\"version\":\"4.21.0-2021120601\",\"description\":\"We have improved campaign reporting availability and updated to utilize Ruby 3.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20211206/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20211216\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20211216\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-12-16\",\"version\":\"4.21.0-2021121601\",\"description\":\"We updated the Log4j dependency and improved the restore of a schedule for a suspended task chain.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20211216/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20211221\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20211221\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-12-21\",\"version\":\"4.21.0-2021122101\",\"description\":\"We have updated Metasploit Pro to use the latest version of Log4j (2.17).\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20211221/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20220104\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20220104\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2022-01-04\",\"version\":\"4.21.0-2022010401\",\"description\":\"We have updated Metasploit Framework and other dependencies.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20220104/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20220131\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20220131\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2022-01-31\",\"version\":\"4.21.0-2022013101\",\"description\":\"Updates Metasploit Framework version to 6.1.27\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20220131/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20220211\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20220211\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2022-02-11\",\"version\":\"4.21.0-2022021101\",\"description\":\"We updated our installers to better support hardened Linux installs.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20220211/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20220228\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20220228\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2022-02-28\",\"version\":\"4.21.0-2022022801\",\"description\":\"We improved the Social Engineering Campaign Findings workflow to better detect when Report Generation is available.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20220228/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20220314\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20220314\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2022-03-14\",\"version\":\"4.21.0-2022031401\",\"description\":\"We enhanced Global Settings with new options.\",\"title\":\"New | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20220314/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20220328\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20220328\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2022-03-28\",\"version\":\"4.21.0-2022032801\",\"description\":\"We improved signal support for CLI interaction and fixed SSL web crawling.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20220328/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20220413\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20220413\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2022-04-13\",\"version\":\"4.21.0-2022041301\",\"description\":\"We updated to the latest framework version and improved error messages for duplicate social engineering targets.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20220413/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20220426\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20220426\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2022-04-26\",\"version\":\"4.21.0-2022042601\",\"description\":\"We updated support for 'Debug' payloads and fixed worker service stablity that was impacting backup and reporting functionality.\",\"title\":\"New | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20220426/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20220509\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20220509\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2022-05-09\",\"version\":\"4.21.0-2022050901\",\"description\":\"Updates Metasploit Framework to 6.1.41.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20220509/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20220524\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20220524\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2022-05-24\",\"version\":\"4.21.0-2022052401\",\"description\":\"We have updated the Java runtime utilized in report generation to maintain a strong security posture.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20220524/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20220606\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20220606\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2022-06-06\",\"version\":\"4.21.1-2022060601\",\"description\":\"We now utilize Metasploit Framework 6.2.x, and adjusted encoding of task logs included in an activity report to only include UTF-8 compatible characters.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20220606/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20220624\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20220624\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2022-06-24\",\"version\":\"4.21.1-2022062401\",\"description\":\"We improved support for non UTF-8 OS installs, and platform independent restore of backups.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20220624/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20220701\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20220701\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2022-07-01\",\"version\":\"4.21.1-2022070101\",\"description\":\"We improved backup functionality to avoid partial download of a backup.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20220701/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20220718\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20220718\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2022-07-18\",\"version\":\"4.21.1-2022071801\",\"description\":\"We updated dependencies in reporting to maintain a strong security posture.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20220718/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20220803\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20220803\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2022-08-03\",\"version\":\"4.21.1-2022080301\",\"description\":\"We exposed additional module metadata and fixed a reporting failure on Windows.\",\"title\":\"New | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20220803/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20220816\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20220816\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2022-08-16\",\"version\":\"4.21.1-2022081601\",\"description\":\"We expanded the information available about module readiness and improved argument parsing and error handling for the CLI.\",\"title\":\"New | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20220816/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20220830\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20220830\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2022-08-30\",\"version\":\"4.21.1-2022083001\",\"description\":\"We improved Vulnerability Validation findings and fixed Social Engineering report generation.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20220830/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20220912\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20220912\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2022-09-12\",\"version\":\"4.21.1-2022091201\",\"description\":\"We improved uniqueness of tracking data across campaigns and improved report settings for task chains.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20220912/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20220926\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20220926\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2022-09-26\",\"version\":\"4.21.1-2022092601\",\"description\":\"We improved validation of backup names, improved edit and restored delete functionality on single host analysis view.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20220926/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20221010\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20221010\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2022-10-10\",\"version\":\"4.21.1-2022101001\",\"description\":\"We improved statistics reported for social engineering campaigns and updated to the latest Metasploit Framework version.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20221010/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20221024\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20221024\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2022-10-24\",\"version\":\"4.21.1-2022102401\",\"description\":\"We improved status of task chains. We also improved UX of task chains by storing in progress schedule information.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20221024/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20221104\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20221104\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2022-11-04\",\"version\":\"4.21.1-2022110401\",\"description\":\"We improved icons on task chains schedule states and fixed a failure when importing from a Nexpose/InsightVM console.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20221104/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20221202\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20221202\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2022-12-02\",\"version\":\"4.21.1-2022120201\",\"description\":\"We improved logs during execution of basic tasks and in Social Engineering campaigns. We also improved error handling during execution of bruteforce module when it reports incomplete data.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20221202/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20230117\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20230117\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2023-01-17\",\"version\":\"4.21.1-2023011701\",\"description\":\"We restored external imports and improved resilience of brute force task execution.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20230117/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20230130\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20230130\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2023-01-30\",\"version\":\"4.22.0-2023013001\",\"description\":\"We added support for the latest Metasploit Framework 6.3 Kerberos features, and addressed a reported XSS related security issue.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20230130/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20230213\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20230213\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2023-02-13\",\"version\":\"4.22.0-2023021301\",\"description\":\"We addressed an issue with adding modules to post exploitation macros.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20230213/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20230227\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20230227\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2023-02-27\",\"version\":\"4.22.0-2023022701\",\"description\":\"We improved the consistency of dates and times in reports. We also improved the task log details page to offer cleanup tasks only when applicable.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20230227/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20230314\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20230314\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2023-03-14\",\"version\":\"4.22.0-2023031401\",\"description\":\"We improved the enforcement of global SMTP settings, reference links within modules, and timeout error handling for auxiliary modules.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20230314/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20230327\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20230327\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2023-03-27\",\"version\":\"4.22.0-2023032701\",\"description\":\"We improved imports for NTLM hash files and enhnaced session disconnect handling.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20230327/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20230411\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20230411\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2023-04-11\",\"version\":\"4.22.0-2023041101\",\"description\":\"We improved project access details, task chain cloning, and report generation requirements.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20230411/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20230424\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20230424\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2023-04-24\",\"version\":\"4.22.0-2023042401\",\"description\":\"We improved error visibility for task chains and SMTP settings validation.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20230424/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20230509\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20230509\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2023-05-09\",\"version\":\"4.22.0-2023050901\",\"description\":\"We fixed large network topology loading and updated to the latest Metasploit Framework.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20230509/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20230522\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20230522\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2023-05-22\",\"version\":\"4.22.1-2023052201\",\"description\":\"We have updated the version of Metasploit Framework to include new command fetch payloads, along with other dependencies.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20230522/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20230605\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20230605\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2023-06-05\",\"version\":\"4.22.1-2023060501\",\"description\":\"We introduced a new overview card that shows any upcoming or interrupted scheduled task chains. We also added a fix that resolves an issue with deleting credentials from a workspace.\",\"title\":\"New | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20230605/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20230623\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20230623\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2023-06-23\",\"version\":\"4.22.1-2023062301\",\"description\":\"We improved the scaling of project related modules, fixed web vulnerablity display across projects, and improved workflow or adhoc creation of connections to Nexpose/InsightVM consoles.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20230623/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20230705\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20230705\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2023-07-05\",\"version\":\"4.22.1-2023070501\",\"description\":\"We have updated the version of Metasploit Framework to include a number of module and payload improvements.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20230705/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20230717\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20230717\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2023-07-17\",\"version\":\"4.22.1-2023071701\",\"description\":\"We fixed an issue with displaying proof section of weak SSL ciphers during a web scan and we added a fix related to display of disclosed vulnerabilities for a host when generating reference links.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20230717/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20230731\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20230731\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2023-07-31\",\"version\":\"4.22.2-2023073101\",\"description\":\"We have added schedule and retention functionality for backups in the UI, auto payload selection, and other improvements.\",\"title\":\"New | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20230731/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20231004\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20231004\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2023-10-04\",\"version\":\"4.22.2-2023092901\",\"description\":\"We have updated the version of Metasploit Framework to include new modules and enhancements.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20231004/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20240215\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20240215\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2024-02-15\",\"version\":\"4.22.2-2024021501\",\"description\":\"We have updated the version of Metasploit Framework to include new modules and enhancements.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20240215/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20240313\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20240313\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2024-03-13\",\"version\":\"4.22.2-2024031301\",\"description\":\"We have updated the version of Metasploit Framework to include new modules and enhancements.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20240313/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20240403\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20240403\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2024-04-03\",\"version\":\"4.22.3-2024040301\",\"description\":\"We have updated the version of Metasploit Framework to 6.4 which enables new PostgreSQL, MSSQL, MySQL and SMB session types as well as providing Kerberos and Meterpreter payload improvements.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20240403/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20240417\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20240417\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2024-04-17\",\"version\":\"4.22.3-2024041701\",\"description\":\"We have updated the version of Metasploit Framework to include new modules and enhancements.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20240417/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20240503\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20240503\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2024-05-03\",\"version\":\"4.22.3-2024050201\",\"description\":\"We have updated the version of Metasploit Framework to include new modules and enhancements.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20240503/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20240523\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20240523\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2024-05-23\",\"version\":\"4.22.2-2024052301\",\"description\":\"We have updated the version of Metasploit Framework to include new modules and enhancements.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20240523/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20240610\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20240610\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2024-06-10\",\"version\":\"4.22.2-2024061001\",\"description\":\"We have updated the version of Metasploit Framework to include new modules and enhancements.\",\"title\":\"Fixed | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20240610/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Fixed | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20240620\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20240620\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2024-06-20\",\"version\":\"4.22.2-2024062001\",\"description\":\"We have updated the version of Metasploit Framework to include new modules and enhancements.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20240620/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20240715\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20240715\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2024-07-15\",\"version\":\"4.22.2-2024071501\",\"description\":\"We have made multiple improvements to Metasploit's scanning capabilities and the PCI Compliance Report.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20240715/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20240719\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20240719\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2024-07-19\",\"version\":\"4.22.2-2024071901\",\"description\":\"We resolved issues impacting bruteforce capabilities, vhost discovery, and quick penetration testing functionality for non-admin users.\",\"title\":\"Fixed | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20240719/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Fixed | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20240725\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20240725\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2024-07-25\",\"version\":\"4.22.2-2024072501\",\"description\":\"We have updated the version of Metasploit Framework to include new modules and enhancements.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20240725/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20240819\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20240819\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2024-08-19\",\"version\":\"4.22.3-2024081901\",\"description\":\"We have improved the stability of Metasploit Pro for Windows environments when starting. The Bruteforce capabilities have performance enhancements to support larger credentials lists. This release includes 8 new modules, such as Apache HugeGraph Server CVE-2024-27348, FortiClient EMS FCTID CVE-2023-48788, and more.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20240819/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20240822\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20240822\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2024-08-22\",\"version\":\"4.22.3-2024082201\",\"description\":\"The Jenkins bruteforce capabilities now correctly identify when Jenkins requires authentication. This release also includes 3 new modules, including two SQL injection modules for DIAEnergie and Fortra FileCatalyst, as well as a SPIP Unauthenticated RCE Exploit.\",\"title\":\"Fixed | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20240822/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Fixed | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20240916\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20240916\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2024-09-16\",\"version\":\"4.22.4-2024091601\",\"description\":\"We have updated Metasploit Pro's bruteforce capabilities to now support LDAP scanning. Metasploit Pro's network scanning capabilities have been improved. This release also includes 7 new modules, such as pgAdmin CVE-2024-3116, Ivanti Virtual Traffic Manager (vTM) CVE-2024-7593, and more. Users that are connecting to a Windows environment to perform their Metasploit Pro updates or installs (either via RDP, SSH, or similar) might have their connections to the server temporarily disconnect during this update - this is required to support the latest network scanning capabilities in Metasploit Pro.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20240916/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20241014\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20241014\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2024-10-14\",\"version\":\"4.22.4-2024101401\",\"description\":\"We have updated Metasploit Pro's bruteforce capabilities to now support Kerberos scanning. We have also fixed multiple issues for Windows Server 2022 installations, as well as improved the installation time and bootup stability on all environments. This release also contains 8 new modules.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20241014/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20241028\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20241028\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2024-10-28\",\"version\":\"4.22.5-2024102801\",\"description\":\"This release updates the Ruby and nginx components of Metasploit Pro, and includes enhancements for ESC-15 and 4 new modules.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20241028/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20241106\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20241106\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2024-11-06\",\"version\":\"4.22.5-2024110601\",\"description\":\"Fixes an issue were users were unable to delete bulk credentials via the select all option when managing credentials for a project.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20241106/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20241114\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20241114\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2024-11-14\",\"version\":\"4.22.5-2024111401\",\"description\":\"Adds additional logging and diagnostic tooling support for Metasploit Pro, as well 10 new modules including SolarWinds Web Help Desk (CVE-2024-28987) and more.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20241114/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20241119\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20241119\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2024-11-19\",\"version\":\"4.22.6-2024111901\",\"description\":\"Updates the PostgreSQL version to 13. This upgrade may take more time than usual to complete.\",\"title\":\"Enhancements | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20241119/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Enhancements | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20241206\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20241206\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2024-12-06\",\"version\":\"4.22.7-2024120601\",\"description\":\"Multiple enhancements have been added to Metasploit Pro including improving the Quick Pentest functionality to include detecting unauthenticated Redis instances, adding support for bruteforcing TeamCity targets, and new exploit capabilities for OpenPrinting CUPS - which runs by default on most Linux distributions, and more.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20241206/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20250122\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20250122\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2025-01-22\",\"version\":\"4.22.7-2025012201\",\"description\":\"The module run page now allows users to select between executing the check or run capabilities of a Metasploit module. This release also contains multiple stability improvements including reduced startup time, enhanced support for restoring backups on newer versions of Chrome, enhanced diagnostics tooling, and more.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20250122/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20250220\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20250220\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2025-02-20\",\"version\":\"4.22.7-2025022001\",\"description\":\"Fixes outdated documentation links. Users can now right-click and paste wordlists into the bruteforce page. Includes fixes for the stop tasks button not visually updating the module status, and better error handling when failing to reset the user's password. Multiple enhancements for LDAP and ESC features including ESC15 patch detection within the `icpr_cert` module. New modules include support for targeting CraftCMS, LibreNMS, mySCADA, and more.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20250220/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20250406\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20250406\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2025-04-06\",\"version\":\"4.22.7-2025040601\",\"description\":\"Enhances the module search capabilities, users can now search for fetch payloads and refine their search results with additional search terms. Adds support for replaying previously run modules and MetaModules from the tasklist view. Fixes multiple bugs including improvements for Linux targets. Adds new exploits targeting BeyondTrust, MySCADA, SCCM and more.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20250406/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20250421\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20250421\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2025-04-21\",\"version\":\"4.22.7-2025042101\",\"description\":\"This release adds clearer error messages for invalid Nexpose console configuration, additional insights into the HTTP/HTTPS bruteforce targets, a new card view for module search, and fixes and improvements to the backup restoration process, as well as overall service stability when booting. This release also adds support for multiple new exploit modules targeting CrushFTP, pgAdmin, Oracle Access Manager (OAM), and more.\",\"title\":\"Enhancements and features (6) | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20250421/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Enhancements and features (6) | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20250501\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20250501\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2025-05-01\",\"version\":\"4.22.7-2025050101\",\"description\":\"This release adds workflow improvements for replaying tasks, and storing PKCS#12 files as credentials in the Manage Credentials page. Improvements have been added for LDAP Active Directory secret extraction, as well as introducing new modules for exploiting BentoML (CVE-2025-32375), Craft CMS (CVE-2025-32432), and more.\",\"title\":\"Enhancements and features | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20250501/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Enhancements and features | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20250512\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20250512\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2025-05-12\",\"version\":\"4.22.7-2025051201\",\"description\":\"Introduces several enhancements, including improved web app testing with server name indication support, auxiliary module now show in in the related modules tab, and customizable Nmap host discovery options. New modules include exploits for CVE-2025-32433 and CVE-2025-2264, alongside a login scanner for OPNSense, and more.\",\"title\":\"New module content (4) | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20250512/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New module content (4) | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20250522\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20250522\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2025-05-22\",\"version\":\"4.22.7-2025052201\",\"description\":\"Fixes a crash when loading the exploit scan page, as well as other stability improvements.\",\"title\":\"Enhancements and features (1) | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20250522/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Enhancements and features (1) | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20250612\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20250612\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2025-06-12\",\"version\":\"4.22.7-2025061201\",\"description\":\"This version introduces 24 new modules, including RCEs for Ivanti EPM and Connect Secure, and Kerberos attack modules. It also features one enhanced module, 16 general enhancements (e.g., UI improvements, SOCKS5H support, Kerberoast and ASREP roasting additions), and 25 bug fixes covering various crashes, UI issues, and module functionalities.\",\"title\":\"New module content (24) | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20250612/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New module content (24) | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20250619\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20250619\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2025-06-19\",\"version\":\"4.22.7-2025061901\",\"description\":\"This version improves logging when running msfupdate on Linux environments.\",\"title\":\"Enhancements and features (2) | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20250619/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Enhancements and features (2) | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20250630\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20250630\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2025-06-30\",\"version\":\"4.22.8-2025063001\",\"description\":\"Introduces four new RCE exploit modules targeting vulnerabilities in vBulletin, WP Tatsu, Window's UNC path handling in .url files, and more.\",\"title\":\"New module content (4) | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20250630/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New module content (4) | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20250718\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20250718\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2025-07-18\",\"version\":\"4.22.8-2025071801\",\"description\":\"This release adds 6 new modules and includes fixes to the Quick PenTest wizard, improved vulnerability attempt tracking, security updates and module bug fixes.\",\"title\":\"New module content (7) | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20250718/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New module content (7) | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20250730\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20250730\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2025-07-30\",\"version\":\"4.22.8-2025073001\",\"description\":\"This release adds 5 new modules, enhances 1 module, and fixes 1 bug. It includes new modules for Xorcom CompletePBX vulnerabilities, a WordPress SQL injection gather module, and fileformat modules for Windows Registry and JScript files.\",\"title\":\"New module content (5) | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20250730/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New module content (5) | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20250804\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/20250804\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2025-08-04\",\"description\":\"This document is no longer updated as of August 4, 2025. Read new release notes in the Command Platform Help.\",\"title\":\"release-notes-metasploit-eol-notice | Metasploit Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/metasploit/20250804/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"release-notes-metasploit-eol-notice | Metasploit Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"page\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/page\",\"children\":[{\"name\":\"10\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/page/10\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Metasploit Release Notes - Page 10\",\"description\":\"Release notes for Metasploit - Page 10\"},\"title\":\"Metasploit Release Notes - Page 10\"},{\"name\":\"2\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/page/2\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Metasploit Release Notes - Page 2\",\"description\":\"Release notes for Metasploit - Page 2\"},\"title\":\"Metasploit Release Notes - Page 2\"},{\"name\":\"3\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/page/3\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Metasploit Release Notes - Page 3\",\"description\":\"Release notes for Metasploit - Page 3\"},\"title\":\"Metasploit Release Notes - Page 3\"},{\"name\":\"4\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/page/4\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Metasploit Release Notes - Page 4\",\"description\":\"Release notes for Metasploit - Page 4\"},\"title\":\"Metasploit Release Notes - Page 4\"},{\"name\":\"5\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/page/5\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Metasploit Release Notes - Page 5\",\"description\":\"Release notes for Metasploit - Page 5\"},\"title\":\"Metasploit Release Notes - Page 5\"},{\"name\":\"6\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/page/6\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Metasploit Release Notes - Page 6\",\"description\":\"Release notes for Metasploit - Page 6\"},\"title\":\"Metasploit Release Notes - Page 6\"},{\"name\":\"7\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/page/7\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Metasploit Release Notes - Page 7\",\"description\":\"Release notes for Metasploit - Page 7\"},\"title\":\"Metasploit Release Notes - Page 7\"},{\"name\":\"8\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/page/8\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Metasploit Release Notes - Page 8\",\"description\":\"Release notes for Metasploit - Page 8\"},\"title\":\"Metasploit Release Notes - Page 8\"},{\"name\":\"9\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/metasploit/page/9\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Metasploit Release Notes - Page 9\",\"description\":\"Release notes for Metasploit - Page 9\"},\"title\":\"Metasploit Release Notes - Page 9\"}],\"title\":\"Page\"}],\"title\":\"Metasploit\"},{\"name\":\"nexpose\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/nexpose\",\"children\":[{\"name\":\"index\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/nexpose\",\"frontMatter\":{\"title\":\"Nexpose Release Notes - Page 1\",\"description\":\"Release notes for Nexpose - Page 1\"},\"title\":\"Nexpose Release Notes - Page 1\"},{\"name\":\"20200122\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/nexpose/20200122\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2020-12-2\",\"version\":\"6.6.55\",\"description\":\"Take advantage of the new customer requested macOS policy shipped in this release. We've also fixed a few issues.\",\"title\":\"New | Nexpose Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/nexpose/20200122/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | Nexpose Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20200129\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/nexpose/20200129\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2020-12-9\",\"version\":\"6.6.56\",\"description\":\"In addition to delivering Microsoft Patch Tuesday coverage for December 2020, this release also includes feature improvements and fixes.\",\"title\":\"New | Nexpose Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/nexpose/20200129/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | Nexpose Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20200916\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/nexpose/20200916\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2020-09-16\",\"version\":\"6.6.43\",\"description\":\"This release includes fixes for scanning issues that caused excessive memory consumption.\",\"title\":\"Fixed | Nexpose Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/nexpose/20200916/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Fixed | Nexpose Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20200923\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/nexpose/20200923\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2020-09-23\",\"version\":\"6.6.44\",\"description\":\"In this release, we've updated one of our Ubuntu Linux policies, improved scan performance, improved fingerprint accuracy, and made several fixes.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Nexpose Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/nexpose/20200923/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Nexpose Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20200930\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/nexpose/20200930\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2020-09-30\",\"version\":\"6.6.46\",\"description\":\"This release includes updated DISA policy content, improved scan engine performance, and several fixes.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Nexpose Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/nexpose/20200930/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Nexpose Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20201007\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/nexpose/20201007\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2020-10-07\",\"version\":\"6.6.47\",\"description\":\"Shorten false positive evaluation times with our new investigation tool shipped in this product version. This release also includes several policy updates and fixes.\",\"title\":\"New | Nexpose Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/nexpose/20201007/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | Nexpose Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20201014\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/nexpose/20201014\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2020-10-14\",\"version\":\"6.6.49\",\"description\":\"In this release we've got updated scan coverage for October 2020, plus some improvements and fixes.\",\"title\":\"New | Nexpose Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/nexpose/20201014/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | Nexpose Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20201021\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/nexpose/20201021\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2020-10-21\",\"version\":\"6.6.50\",\"description\":\"This release includes fixes for vulnerability content and software fingerprinting.\",\"title\":\"Fixed | Nexpose Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/nexpose/20201021/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Fixed | Nexpose Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20201028\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/nexpose/20201028\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2020-10-28\",\"version\":\"6.6.51\",\"description\":\"We now support recurring vulnerability coverage for Pulse Connect Secure, and we released a few improvements and fixes.\",\"title\":\"New | Nexpose Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/nexpose/20201028/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | Nexpose Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20201104\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/nexpose/20201104\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2020-11-04\",\"version\":\"6.6.52\",\"description\":\"Take advantage of some new scan template optimizations in this release.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Nexpose Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/nexpose/20201104/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Nexpose Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20201111\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/nexpose/20201111\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2020-11-11\",\"version\":\"6.6.53\",\"description\":\"This release includes Patch Tuesday coverage for November 2020 and some fixes.\",\"title\":\"New | Nexpose Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/nexpose/20201111/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | Nexpose Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20201118\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/nexpose/20201118\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2020-11-18\",\"version\":\"6.6.54\",\"description\":\"This release includes new policy content and general Security Console fixes.\",\"title\":\"New | Nexpose Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/nexpose/20201118/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | Nexpose Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20201216\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/nexpose/20201216\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2020-12-16\",\"version\":\"6.6.57\",\"description\":\"This release ships several customer-requested additions and new vulnerability coverage, updates our DISA policy content, and fixes some issues.\",\"title\":\"New | Nexpose Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/nexpose/20201216/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | Nexpose Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20201229\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/nexpose/20201229\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2020-12-29\",\"description\":\"This content release contains a new vulnerability check for CVE-2020-10148 affecting the SolarWinds API.\",\"title\":\"New | Nexpose Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/nexpose/20201229/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | Nexpose Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20210105\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/nexpose/20210105\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-1-5\",\"description\":\"This content release contains a new vulnerability check for CVE-2020-15505 affecting MobileIron products.\",\"title\":\"New | Nexpose Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/nexpose/20210105/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | Nexpose Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20210107\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/nexpose/20210107\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-1-7\",\"version\":\"6.6.58\",\"description\":\"This release only provides installers containing the latest content for offline deployments.\",\"title\":\"release-notes-6.6.58 | Nexpose Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/nexpose/20210107/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"release-notes-6.6.58 | Nexpose Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20210113\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/nexpose/20210113\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-1-13\",\"version\":\"6.6.59\",\"description\":\"This release includes Microsoft Patch Tuesday coverage for January 2021, enhances the Scan Engine, and fixes several issues.\",\"title\":\"New | Nexpose Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/nexpose/20210113/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | Nexpose Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20210120\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/nexpose/20210120\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-1-20\",\"version\":\"6.6.60\",\"description\":\"This release contains a fix for VMware ESXi scanning scenarios.\",\"title\":\"Fixes | Nexpose Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/nexpose/20210120/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Fixes | Nexpose Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20210121\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/nexpose/20210121\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-1-21\",\"version\":\"6.6.61\",\"description\":\"This release contains a fix for an error that could arise from adjusting Security Console user accounts.\",\"title\":\"Fixes | Nexpose Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/nexpose/20210121/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Fixes | Nexpose Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20210127\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/nexpose/20210127\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-1-27\",\"version\":\"6.6.62\",\"description\":\"This release includes new console commands for log time zone configuration and several fixes.\",\"title\":\"New | Nexpose Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/nexpose/20210127/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | Nexpose Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20210203\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/nexpose/20210203\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-2-3\",\"version\":\"6.6.63\",\"description\":\"This release adds the beta edition of the new Metasploit Remote Check Service and fixes some issues.\",\"title\":\"New | Nexpose Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/nexpose/20210203/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | Nexpose Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20210204\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/nexpose/20210204\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-2-4\",\"version\":\"6.6.65\",\"description\":\"This release fixes a Security Console startup issue found in version 6.6.64.\",\"title\":\"Fixed | Nexpose Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/nexpose/20210204/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Fixed | Nexpose Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20210204-1\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/nexpose/20210204-1\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-2-4\",\"version\":\"6.6.64\",\"description\":\"This release fixes a Security Console startup issue found in version 6.6.63.\",\"title\":\"Fixed | Nexpose Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/nexpose/20210204-1/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Fixed | Nexpose Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20210210\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/nexpose/20210210\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-2-10\",\"version\":\"6.6.67\",\"description\":\"This release includes Microsoft Patch Tuesday coverage for February 2021, adds new recurring coverage for VMware, and fixes several issues.\",\"title\":\"New | Nexpose Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/nexpose/20210210/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | Nexpose Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20210217\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/nexpose/20210217\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-2-17\",\"version\":\"6.6.68\",\"description\":\"This release includes asset correlation improvements, more filtered asset search criteria, and several APIv3 related fixes.\",\"title\":\"New | Nexpose Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/nexpose/20210217/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | Nexpose Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20210224\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/nexpose/20210224\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-2-24\",\"version\":\"6.6.69\",\"description\":\"This release includes asset correlation and software fingerprinting fixes.\",\"title\":\"Fixed | Nexpose Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/nexpose/20210224/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Fixed | Nexpose Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20210303\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/nexpose/20210303\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-3-03\",\"version\":\"6.6.70\",\"description\":\"This release includes updated policy content and fixes for vulnerability investigations and the Top Remediations with Details report.\",\"title\":\"New | Nexpose Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/nexpose/20210303/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | Nexpose Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20210310\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/nexpose/20210310\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2021-3-10\",\"version\":\"6.6.71\",\"description\":\"In addition to Patch Tuesday content for March, this release includes new recurring vulnerability coverage and policy content.\",\"title\":\"New | Nexpose Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/nexpose/20210310/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | Nexpose Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20210