.\",\"title\":\"Improved | Nexpose Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/nexpose/20250108/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Improved | Nexpose Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20250115\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/nexpose/20250115\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2025-01-15\",\"version\":\"7.3.0\",\"description\":\"This release includes an update to the Apache Tomcat policy, an improvement, and several bug fixes.\",\"title\":\"New | Nexpose Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/nexpose/20250115/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | Nexpose Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20250123\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/nexpose/20250123\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2025-01-23\",\"version\":\"7.3.2\",\"description\":\"This release fixes an issue that prevented scans being scheduled or started in some installations.\",\"title\":\"Fixed | Nexpose Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/nexpose/20250123/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"Fixed | Nexpose Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20250130\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/nexpose/20250130\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2025-01-30\",\"version\":\"7.4.0\",\"description\":\"This release includes new CVSSv2 scores and bug fixes for the Remediation Hub and VMWare discovery connections.\",\"title\":\"New | Nexpose Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/nexpose/20250130/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | Nexpose Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"20250205\",\"route\":\"/release-notes/nexpose/20250205\",\"frontMatter\":{\"createdAt\":\"2025-02-05\",\"version\":\"7.5.0\",\"description\":\"This release includes a new feature in the Remediation Hub, updated policy coverage, and several bug fixes.\",\"title\":\"New | Nexpose Documentation\",\"filePath\":\"src/content/release-notes/nexpose/20250205/index.mdx\",\"timestamp\":1783707814950},\"title\":\"New | Nexpose Documentation\"},{\"name\":\"202